<component>
    <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.kbd.title")}</h2>
        <p>Kbd 是 RML 的键盘按键组件，标签为 PascalCase <code>Kbd</code>。构造器接受 <code>Keystroke</code> 类型：<code>key="cmd-a"</code> 生成 <code>Kbd::new(Keystroke::parse("cmd-a").expect(...))</code>。RenderOnce 无 ElementId，由专属 <code>compiler/kbd</code> 模块处理 <code>key</code> 属性提取。平台相关显示：macOS 显示 ⌘A，Windows 显示 Ctrl+A。</p>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>修饰键 + 字母：</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px">
                <Kbd key="cmd-a" />
                <Kbd key="ctrl-c" />
                <Kbd key="ctrl-shift-c" />
                <Kbd key="alt-tab" />
            </div>
            <p>功能键：</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px">
                <Kbd key="enter" />
                <Kbd key="escape" />
                <Kbd key="backspace" />
                <Kbd key="delete" />
                <Kbd key="space" />
                <Kbd key="tab" />
            </div>
            <p>方向键：</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px">
                <Kbd key="up" />
                <Kbd key="down" />
                <Kbd key="left" />
                <Kbd key="right" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="样式变体">
            <p><code>outline</code> 样式：</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px">
                <Kbd key="cmd-a" outline="" />
                <Kbd key="ctrl-shift-v" outline="" />
            </div>
            <p><code>appearance="false"</code>（仅文本，无背景）：</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px">
                <Kbd key="cmd-a" appearance="false" />
                <Kbd key="ctrl-c" appearance="false" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <p>点击下方 Tab 切换 <code>.rml</code> 声明文件与 <code>.rml.rs</code> 后端文件：</p>
            <TabBar selected-index={code_tab} on-click={on_code_tab_change}>
                <Tab label=".rml">
                    <CodeEditor ref="rml_editor" value={rml_sample} language="rml" />
                </Tab>
                <Tab label=".rml.rs">
                    <CodeEditor ref="rust_editor" value={rust_sample} language="rust" />
                </Tab>
            </TabBar>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <h3>Kbd</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
